<div class="section" id="outlook-and-conclusions">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">6</div>
    <h2>Outlook &amp; Conclusions</h2>
  </div>

  <p>The dataset concludes in March 2026 at <strong>$87.84/bbl</strong>, a level that is above the 2020s average of $71.75/bbl but well within the range of the 2010s. The most recent 12 months (Apr 2025 – Mar 2026) show prices oscillating between $57.95 and $87.84/bbl, with the March 2026 data point representing the highest reading since early 2023.</p>

